 the moon to go camping, cook food, play with toys, feed small animals, catch the sea, and experience weightlessness. fun and more...you will find your inner peace and happiness.", "short_description": "Camping is a popular outdoor activity, and it is the heart of urban people under the boring and repetitive life scenes. Now, through VR technology, the mind can still travel far without the physical body."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.miniseavr.cn/?p=17842", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MiniSea", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.miniseavr.cn/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION", "SIMULATION", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2977316295913578"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2149666635400182"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1692615861545508"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "214587078024081"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1692615861545508"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1702400395, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2149666635400182"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "7819243531428267", "version": "1.41"}, "id": "3188784854776957", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binarie